  "labels": [
    {
      "label": "T_PlayingByAppointment",
      "span": "Game play is all timers",
      "rationale": "The span describes timers that impose waiting within gameplay."
    },
    {
      "label": "M_PayToProgress",
      "span": "want to do 2 buildings at once then pay $",
      "rationale": "The span describes paying to bypass or speed building progress by allowing concurrent construction."
    }
  ],
  "invoked_web_search": false,
  "search_query": null,
  "search_result": null
}

{
  "analysis": "The review describes accumulated time and money making quitting feel costly and difficult, which satisfies Easy to Get, Hard to Lose. The general statements that the game is a scam or addictive are evaluations and do not independently identify mechanics. No grinding, recurring fee, or other codable mechanic is described.",
